"set_tid[2] = 31496;\n"
"set_tid_size = 3;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/clone.2:333
msgid ""
"If only the PIDs in the two innermost PID namespaces need to be specified, "
"set the array to:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
